**Short trick∶**

Angle made by Chinese Dishes = 90&deg;

&there4; Required change = 90&deg; × 20/100 = 18&deg;

**Detailed solution∶**

Total amount collected by selling four items = 27000

Percentage amount collected by selling Chinese dishes = (90/360) × 100 = 25%

Amount collected by selling Chinese dishes = 27000 × (25/100) = 6750

Given,

New amount collected by selling Chinese dishes = 6750 &ndash; [6750 × (20/100)] = 5400

Percentage amount collected by selling Chinese dishes = (5400/27000) × 100 = 20%

New degree = 20/100 × 360 = 72&deg;

&there4; Change in degree = 90&deg; &ndash; 72&deg; = 18&deg;
